# Canonical test song (valid): crates/note_spelling/src/spelled_line.rs, test `five_in_a_quarter`.
# Five eighth-note-sized notes in one quarter (fitQ): the spelling cannot draw it and must say so.
song "T"
track "Clock"
  type clock_and_transport
track "Keys"
  type poly_voice
  clef grand
  lead
section "A"
  key C major  meter 4/4  tempo 120 beats/min
  line "Keys"  | fitQ(C4:e D4 E4 F4 G4) A4:q B4:h |

song_composition
  key C major  meter 4/4  tempo 100 beats/min
  "A"
song_composition_close
